WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.098
This is Centaur.

2
00:00:02.596 --> 00:00:04.389
Your reps spend their day in deals.

3
00:00:05.244 --> 00:00:08.320
You need to see the whole picture, without chasing anyone for an update.

4
00:00:09.102 --> 00:00:10.545
Dana runs the sales team.

5
00:00:11.274 --> 00:00:13.611
Monday morning, she opens the Pipeline summary.

6
00:00:14.603 --> 00:00:18.697
Open pipeline, new deals this week, win rate and days to close,

7
00:00:18.697 --> 00:00:21.687
each with its trend over the last eight weeks.

8
00:00:22.647 --> 00:00:25.573
The quarter's forecast sits against the team's target,

9
00:00:25.573 --> 00:00:28.446
and a short list shows the deals that need attention.

10
00:00:29.323 --> 00:00:30.650
A close date that's passed.

11
00:00:31.187 --> 00:00:33.288
A deal nobody has touched in two weeks.

12
00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:36.956
The Team briefing tells her the rest in plain words.

13
00:00:37.688 --> 00:00:39.747
How the team is tracking against target.

14
00:00:40.704 --> 00:00:44.615
Which reps are adding more deals than usual, and which are adding fewer.

15
00:00:45.348 --> 00:00:46.386
Which deals have stalled.

16
00:00:47.173 --> 00:00:49.550
Signals shows what buyers are doing right now.

17
00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:54.016
A contact who clicked a link, a reply after months of silence,

18
00:00:54.016 --> 00:00:56.724
a competitor's contract coming up for renewal.

19
00:00:57.503 --> 00:01:00.575
Each one opens the record, or becomes a task for the rep.

20
00:01:01.819 --> 00:01:05.919
And every week, Intelligence looks across every conversation and every deal,

21
00:01:05.919 --> 00:01:07.807
and tells her what keeps coming up.

22
00:01:08.833 --> 00:01:10.606
The competitor turning up more often.

23
00:01:11.555 --> 00:01:12.861
The objection that's growing.

24
00:01:13.367 --> 00:01:15.084
The stage where deals get stuck.

25
00:01:16.212 --> 00:01:18.465
Every number is counted from your own records.

26
00:01:19.253 --> 00:01:21.616
Nothing is estimated, and nothing is made up.

27
00:01:22.596 --> 00:01:23.783
Centaur CRM.

28
00:01:24.622 --> 00:01:27.407
See your whole pipeline, without asking for a spreadsheet.

29
00:01:28.359 --> 00:01:32.420
Book a demonstration today, at centaurcrm.com.

